{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHIKA-Q is an online, real-time puzzle battle played on a 10\u00d710 board where players link blocks to launch rapid-fire attacks and defenses. At the core of the gameplay is music\u2014not merely background sound, but original vocal tracks created to symbolize the battle, delivering an unprecedented sense of immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083790/extras/63e85c2e3d50ec618838e7f1422b7136.avif?t=1768963581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083790/extras_big/63e85c2e3d50ec618838e7f1422b7136.avif?t=1768963581 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbStrategy \u00d7 Ultra-Speed \u00d7 Competitive Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect links on a 10\u00d710 board while executing real-time attacks, disruption, recovery, and special moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to offline play, online battles and ranked matches are planned for the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbChallenge Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player, music-driven mode focused on high-score competition. The progression of the music directly drives gameplay, blending sound and play into a unified experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbCharacters and Worldbuilding</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of distinctive characters, along with customizable UI designs and character-specific emotes, allows players to express themselves during matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbLong-Term Engagement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal Battle Pass DLC with missions and rewards is planned to support long-term play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083790?t=1768963581","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083790?t=1768963581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083790/67d3bd501134c91ac363aa609374b96b8ff8285d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768963581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083790/67d3bd501134c91ac363aa609374b96b8ff8285d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768963581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHIKA-Q is an online, real-time puzzle battle played on a 10\u00d710 board where players link blocks to launch rapid-fire attacks and defenses. At the core of the gameplay is music\u2014not merely background sound, but original vocal tracks created to symbolize the battle, delivering an unprecedented sense of immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083790/extras/63e85c2e3d50ec618838e7f1422b7136.avif?t=1768963581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083790/extras_big/63e85c2e3d50ec618838e7f1422b7136.avif?t=1768963581 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p cl